<p>QuantConnect Cloud supports routing trades to the Bloomberg™ EMSX API Server. In this environment, you can route orders to any of the 1,300+ prime brokerages that Bloomberg supports and you get to leverage the data, server management, and data management from QuantConnect, giving you the best of both worlds. To use Quant Bridge, you need to be a member of an organization on the Trading Firm or Institution <a href='https://www.quantconnect.com/docs/v2/cloud-platform/organizations/tier-features'>tier</a>.</p>

<p>QuantConnect Local Platform can integrate with the Bloomberg™ EMSX API Server or Desktop API (DAPI). This integration allows research, backtesting, opitimization, and live trading through the Bloomberg APIs, on-premises. Quant Bridge is in no way affiliated with or endorsed by Bloomberg™; it is simply an add-on.</p>
